/// days: STANDARD [4, 7], RELAXED [6, 12], OFF [].
///
/// ⚠ THIS ENUM MIRRORS `NUDGE_PACE_OFFSET_DAYS` IN src/lib/nudge-cadence.ts. THE MODULE
/// IS THE SOURCE AND THIS IS THE COPY — schema-follows-module, never the reverse. The
/// direction is forced, not stylistic: that module must import NOTHING so the host UI can
/// render the same clock the sweep enforces (Hinge §6), and tests/nudge-cadence-test.ts
/// asserts the zero-import property structurally. It therefore cannot import this enum,
/// so the two vocabularies are kept in step by hand. Change the module first, then this.
