/// GTC-189 slice 4 — which message an `OutboundMessage` row is.
///
/// ORDINAL FOR THE CHASE, NEVER DAY-NAMED, for exactly the reason GTC-178 Ruling 7 gave
/// `PersonEvent.firstNudgeSentAt`/`secondNudgeSentAt`: GTC-179 makes the cadence
/// adjustable per event and per person, so a member named after a day count starts lying
/// the moment a pace moves. CHASE_FIRST and CHASE_SECOND map one-to-one onto those two
/// stamps, and two legs covers every cadence the tree can resolve to —
/// NUDGE_PACE_OFFSET_DAYS is STANDARD [4,7], RELAXED [6,12], OFF []; NUDGE_MARK_OFFSET_DAYS
/// is GENTLE [5], DONT_CHASE [].
