/// COORDINATOR_BRIEF is ruling W's third kind — "the coordinator is messaged even when she
/// is bringing nothing... her message outlines everyone in her team and everything they
/// are bringing". PRESENT AND UNWRITTEN, and here rather than in a later migration for the
/// reason ruling W itself gave about it: cheaper to meet before this migration than after.
